abstract: >-
  Measured benchmark source snapshots, current implementation source, experimental
  data and verification tools for the associated manuscript. Authored code is
  MIT-licensed; data and data documentation are CC BY 4.0. Third-party dependencies
  retain their own licenses. Full-scale benchmark runs are not rerun by the
  numerical verifier.
